          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Welcome to Stock Research**\n\nStock Research has a free plan ready: 100 calls a month, no card. Call `activate_plan` with a `planRef` to activate it.\nSigned in as: ada@example.com · cus_42\nBalance: 0 credits (~$0.00)\nManage: [Manage account](https://solvapay.com/customer/manage?session=sess_1) (expires in 15 minutes)\nCheckout: [Open checkout](https://solvapay.com/customer/checkout?id=cs_1) (expires in 15 minutes)\n\nTo continue, call `activate_plan` with planRef: \"pln_free\"."
        },
        {
          "type": "resource_link",
          "uri": "https://solvapay.com/customer/manage?session=sess_1",
          "name": "Manage account"
        },
        {
          "type": "resource_link",
          "uri": "https://solvapay.com/customer/checkout?id=cs_1",
          "name": "Open checkout"
